{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1426,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e339f0dff1d0f0182580adcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自由地，鲜明地……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e500ee0d60a579d67fa43c8eaf066e56a30397fc66984a3720b704789d83ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b55ffa8ebfc4e7b63adfc2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧，化为一阵风……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c036b5984f1fe98135ba9b2e475d856269f4c491c3102f7f7608f60826f00593",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1641681e745e9c5ecef512e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂哟~哟~切克切克嘣♪\r\n——呵呵。太阳神同学的独特问候\r\n有着令人心儿跃动的韵律呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25bb1df77718fb5e5902ef53692179de9c2dbb53319eb53c1e0497248d3afac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f53808fdc7ff1e28e769240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想拍一个能感受风的视频，\r\n然后在森林里拍了十小时……\r\n这还能算短吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "353feae312c698f180b00acfc90d99bc018aa6b3fef8821a2125486dd8014991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2faf81e5ee8356ca0722161f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满心期待着他的萌芽与绽放，\r\n不知自己能否为其浇水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be4b326d21149c326ddbf2d1d961ed992d09d970e02fd72a9210a02ee1d4029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f21271be77dff1a01565a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在情人节和粉丝们交换了心意……\r\n温暖的风，这次自己……\r\n将一切连接了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38ac933530dc96bc8cf0c4cf3674aaeaf7c4de30c611963dcacd684fafc5f5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06dbef48995f564be5ac7e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更自由、更高、更快。\r\n──然后，我将成为风……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ae8afe95f9eb22efba01bc358d82d355d36ca8d4b53c638351edb8842edc4c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f59df3883fbb831910c4c41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日和风也是促进开花的惠风呢。\r\n请为花儿带来永远的幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "025418979d58406f22b5907a88da0e90f990c01581b7f53f72bb842da53ec614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19eecea57e60d2feb0621ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这阵风，请好好感受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffaf15b8462c758f64ea5a59d151f8e371b2b6abeb386c3f97c707fce6504a4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b3b9b1cbab3a9869fc7d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天会抚摸到那脸庞。\n吹吧……我最重要的，思念之风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3cad3fc855b88ac522b2ae84dc74e7e964e8c6b4724bc766431fc648afe5701",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cdf2a0a4d5b97a9a3b8b05a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直播……趋势……同接……\r\n不像清风那样容易呢。\r\n用风来比喻的话，能记住吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fae6259bcadfb3cb3f186d1ad26420a6adc3b8a1b27c858512532164f2489b50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "400100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:885c580c510edc82ad09f306",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起享受美妙的音色吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a11c1ecaebd2970d145c4b669fbc071bacf6398eb741038e07c04f0716cc6ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba5b47c11d5e70e90ace9963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起共享短暂的梦境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87cf480f88e0a4516be2d2507937b38a13b1c3fdc720941806c2e03cc8d4574b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d223409c469a9a26766aa3cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到成长为风暴的那天……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6836e5210e702d27101a33762b2f170bf5ac7d5c3e30125222e5d0a38715f8e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b3be0e6159e1cf9bbf02857",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不仅理解我这道风，\r\n甚至还追了上来……\r\n你就像是一道无与伦比的暖风呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd6a2dfed337c9bb170ead0eb059ecb243c7dd9aad057be2ff5daf266ad9e3f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e8046a9c02be80e05a6fca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是传统的证明……\r\n宛如年轮不断迭加的大树一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43091598eefc4f3a0213da5805dd80abaa8925b4078344fdcdc7a7df6f67e552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94172396a18ad0b4dfc4769e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这是金鱼的衣服呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "873f0133fa999dc7c43169c49e3eb1e50f6ea6a56d10e5a773623417c9bb19f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de55274834969901cfe674c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让微风，变得鲜明……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a507f691967776e4d4b5ba1fd65f85f670d09f5decd8fc766eb7d7d17c3b82ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dee9697ef13c9712eb52047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家聚在一起，就像山葡萄一样……\r\n呵呵，真可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae84862148bc040ae2535eebefc3452c617a960f6c54db9f3175e8b1c7b1cc23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1600c2b195de09619b1932a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会开始前，有人悄悄帮我整理好\r\n衣服。呵呵，大家都如暖风一般呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ed3ee864dc1aa2ed633d55533a573b9c0bec56e2b3e15fbf8875dfc2cdc43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45d8200bcb21eac2c441f778",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天空的湛蓝配上花朵点缀……\r\n看起来很棒吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3435ecfd6a1640b5f69b2c99dde4f6cc4fe26450cbbbc5026214fa5890288289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f038f9c5c36a561db405ad65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会借着疾风为你制作点心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d3a01979bf545b95e3fe21a216049eaf90db8ad429fef459f2fff4fed728f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113891a3be7c6ad4ba15aaee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这轻柔如棉的光风……我很喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7574cda13e87acc0f95cc5d205159252ed7d21df0076d5133c40d6ef348c473b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31dd5b8ae2362f585f2b8514",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼～♪如何呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f845afbfa64557c621e13c52143eaa0b1a8a2c89d1a100dcda3a757006e5e74a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae1238e97e098431d48615d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像树叶会随着季节变换般……\r\n我也更换衣服了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "799c2fc4791bbeb39fb135c81673ffda07d573873d26a3e45d37e889bbde6e7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a49d208eeec94b48541803",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，总归冷静下来了。\r\n我很喜欢浅棕色，这是一种\r\r对眼睛温柔的……向阳处的土壤色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15de40ae29116a4509f9d5bf2effc254a1fd276507eb97118f7e22898aaf1c0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56841e83f6e1461252056f59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随风而行，出去走走怎么样？\r\n在随性而至之处创造的回忆，\n也是相当不错的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91cb2ef5cf52a1d4901d9cee9ea5e2ec7b4e4ee7e097d9074299e982923c750e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c926e9d15b564c6a641c76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是传统的证明……\r\n宛如年轮不断迭加的大树一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43091598eefc4f3a0213da5805dd80abaa8925b4078344fdcdc7a7df6f67e552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a792641af2c2edb787fafe7",
