      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6215b296a91872ce5b02df91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像树叶会随着季节变换般……\r\n我也更换衣服了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "799c2fc4791bbeb39fb135c81673ffda07d573873d26a3e45d37e889bbde6e7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f8ccfab4a163b2a4f38254",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f636f0936582b93c11d5e519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "究竟是春风还是秋风……\r\n我会期待的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "710f89c184adb837c20ecaa2f3af2394905917aaa2d66cc46f540409859bffb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f3a8370a4417ab064ee4ca1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吹起了很舒服的风呢。\r\n总觉得有点雀跃……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3daf5b86b30134b6de2a17baf812f438f6a9d75d420dc0ac858b109b722d8e3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26984d9aff044cedce5b1040",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，早安。今天开窗时\r\n吹进来的风也很凉爽……\r\n感觉会是个好日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "775d9beaa56bf2d802c39c0fd4e22ff1e3ebf85c3d1be41c848c726ebfc533d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d7bdcb1bb037b94ddf0db52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天早上起床，都会先打开窗户。\r\n用当天的第一道风让自己清醒，\r\n感觉非常畅快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37e0f94ae4fa9150847245753ca7a95ef4d59dbe3aeeed98b828afee86a43b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0edcb5084f7b3ca68022eee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我中午都是吃便当。\r\n做便当的过程很开心……\r\n最棒的是能自由带去任何地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93341af72b5d70c7efda8b6c07f960dadceaa12bbb2e0c67323241e04d3e8c30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58056fa8e3aed53607c2066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，远方传来了进王的声音……\r\n呵呵呵，她真是一道能让人从午睡中\r\n清醒，卷起漫天樱花的强风呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efcffcfc45d36ef428fa00c2649cef4c742918470ba43ca5c8c12751be8011ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:826948ccd89be6482c091275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚的森林会传来各种声音。\r\n虫、鸟、兽、夜风……\r\n呵呵，风声当然算是一种声音呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e74a60003b2c1641dc3dade2cfb43561d543dc2fb9920f6afba96ff4da12534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1457b9f809be38a0559320e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上散步非常舒服，\r\n但父母曾经骂我这样太缺乏戒心……\r\n我是不是该稍微节制一点呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cb3da5b31d6a2714d91380c8d5b1725740e1f3349e04215ef6aeb6822b50e38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00aeaff7b3b864c07814cf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "古人曾说东风一吹，花香便来……\r\n这味道真的很棒呢。\r\n是小花种的花吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89fb8a4a3e4d3ce3bd6442af2c36913be02dc748d94ad287fe2887a742fe7e41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7881e56b3c130c22206cb0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我趁着早晨凉爽出门散步时，\r\n晨风从背后推了我一把，\r\n让我有动力能在炎热的天气里努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbbc7929e5488ed04ef1a0cc6815f5d684536b4b5aac8f529af3ca9e586d9fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6548df203e0e0da1480c6f93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是适合登山的季节……红叶\r\n当然很棒，但我总觉得越接近冬天，\r\n山中的景色也变得越发艳丽呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbe3d39e82ff5763557c1e94c67f71b6a2cf0fde4cc89c188d5d9e3c6391a31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ac2413f5de066eafa501c0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连手指因秋风而冻僵的冰凉感触，\r\n都让人感到怜爱……\r\n现在就是这样的季节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b674ea2231e230795ced8a8f00bed697050f89a74486d3a6194dfb75210f5413",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:830495d60995a6f6c857661c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早餐烤的司康饼，要来一块吗？\r\n这是带着麦香的凉风拂过鼻尖时，\r\n我做出来的自信之作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "992c42ed2418ab3b212757598cda0e6b220b1c2e712228d904c0cf3a0917729e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:376201c34de6ab62d8138c82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在寻找夜晚残留的香气时，\r\n清晨却已悄然弥漫开来。\n呵呵，真是个急性子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe21052158d908ba9b5eea2a76d81b32d108816650370d9bb4e5318588e8f24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee47c713ae30303697cc9264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "罪恶的轻风……不仅把杂念，\r\n还把上课的内容从记忆中吹跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e4851bc65b3d2e004a11024d4c88102c58a8e6441948a16c27b161c6da7254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b29c16a5c580cb9a276c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以来帮我做下午的点心吗？\r\n一起做的话，我预感会有新风吹来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4497a67c230c2509fd8d438d70e1e051575eda70dd0185c4d53b66b96e875e27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e5427ca1cf65de4d9280a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎到来，训练员。\r\n夜风中飘来的巧克力香味，\r\n让这次邀请也变得更值了",
      "source_fingerprint": "d911520768b1a152d4709decb4a714f1b09426a8786a6db76d9be461e23d227c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9899e785a11bb9eb2ece6dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我打算和小真同学一起\r\n参加森林里动物们的晚会。\r\n训练也请务必一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23aed38749195129418aa0f88e1126185b4b26c59c8ffbcf2ec2ae13b0b64a32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb46ca7618693bce3ce7f4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当看到校门口那不输给春风的笔头菜，\r\n就会想自己也要成为那样的人……\r\n然后，便能从中得到勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8939dbdc92f6edfc3376726b60b009897b432c99fbfc94ddd15711961c28f48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0836ff987a938b5dc88cc2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经把巧克力冰淇淋冷藏好了。\r\n为了不输给这大南风，\r\n卷起袖子大干一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99674214f0cb4d16efbaf9f6926173bdca77edc41d7b2d3a560e24d28ce2a24d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:642e028a22a49328cff98f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天森林的音乐会很愉快呢。\r\n金风越发华丽，\r\n我也不由得跟着哼唱起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59097a17dd27060efdfb559e9e8fac7a67070bd086dbfe0d4424df435ebafa51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42892e557efe12957aa3e3a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质同分给了我一些特制关东煮高汤。\r\n我的便当迎来了好风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc577ef0d0c820935acfe54502fda3689577e3ed964b5f522dbd42f0e027b608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b0a2bff8edb8f9fa4ed79d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2250459b1d1298ed3c4c5066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4353ac54e47225a4b4c4c053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次去学园的胡萝卜田，\r\n都会忍不住深呼吸。\r\n新鲜土壤的浓郁香气闻起来真舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de57b13335be7a2fb29a0b678a724decb0d2b7f96b5eab6dfa80ded9e36f8bf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b8ce5eccec25e1ad202cd78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼～哼哼～哼……♪\r\n从树叶间隙洒下的阳光随风晃动，\r\n看起来就像在跳舞一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b821f23d954ee2af9899a9e6b6af8fb5c934a52b2cf46d283d0ae34087112dcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f44170db0d84d2b7288c08b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……喔，涡轮似乎刚经过这附近。\r\n这里还隐约残留着\r\n强劲又喧闹的雄风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "262a4882b7194827697c562d7c5674fe7fef3daf3f01b1941468f9a26692fec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c355452f00e81d987ccee71f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那本书我究竟看到哪里了呢……\r\n风总是会翻动书页，\r\n让我不晓得自己看到哪一页。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc56193b4aedfc4375f3939d56ae1b079457e4c7c8d5452ef66530f7f8fcf28b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b579c90a2118e11903fd358b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使不知道种在花坛里的花\r\n叫什么名字……还是能看得出来\r\n种花的人是用爱在照顾它们的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "302ed9507af98ffa63b207c7a892a41f4c4097902988e2ff7e5b5430f29c1712",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e73e29e14eb4a53cbe7e9615",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这件衣服后，\r\n果然就会想跳舞呢……我喜欢跳舞，\r\n感觉能用自己的身体捕捉到风与光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83696de0ddf2464c142ce23f0f2f95e8b8ebbd91d6580b3ffb22581f5ecb1d5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d0e1769356cedc37168e849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起穿着这件衣服时，\r\n就能感受到令人愉悦的花风。\r\n我是不是也能变成花朵呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd1a59f185c58f0c42ea6a914eedff194fea37ce942ebcaa3f6062bb4601120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a29efe0ce391548f6707721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉只要穿上这件衣服，\r\n自己就会变成一阵看得见的风，\r\n内心也开始轻盈地舞动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd6c0f1057c86c01bbbc8d6f07ffd36004f1892f3715a28ef296e872d9379bc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f780b39d42ccd96fad469ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我背上的缎带很棒吧。\r\n只要一跑起来，\r\n它就会随风飘动喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc41cea898b5da7e856a65b6ed4a15f6bf36e38f76b564928f6eb943f140e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03becd38b9f8f22854b8a06c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天稍微早起去跑步。\r\n晓风将我的睡意全都吹跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dee0596b2dd18b430d4bc88afd376b47fcaf8925e866276ffb90dfbde46af35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c939dab9f4210a0db199fd71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要去中庭还是顶楼？呵呵，\r\n一边感受风的吹拂\r\n一边享用的午餐最好吃了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "263e5a50464ab42e29d112a3f841305df2dc1930bbe9379adeb10390671a5fb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d10f78f11f5386acdc6452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天回去时稍微绕个路吧。\r\n训练结束后暖烘烘的身子，\r\n用晚风吹凉是最棒的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d106da46dc84573fea309215712674f35b614b23a71b3d5831b14f9a72a792a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b886a1bfc2bc6d39a59e3a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生们宛如春初暖风……\r\n是宣告新季节来临的风。\r\n我也要向前迈进，不能输给她们……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6965c0af592835200ff626ede948a6bd70d7fe7683076593295be3c728f8999b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e023de7382a8318716d9e2e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前阵子有朋友约我晚上出门散步……\r\n咦？原来那是在试胆大会吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a990baefa15285399425d2a2a3952a11f1bd89054aaec1c95fe26669150e950",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e186b673cc1ae31ecebe3715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "栗子、野菇、柿子和银杏……\r\n该用这些秋季的赠礼做什么好呢。\r\n你有什么想吃的东西吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f69703b550dee262503e6b0335bb444bca7207a10b3a27e90ef3c3c0cac4d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7ad38afea93af004110b39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外套……一定要穿吗？\r\n穿轻薄的衣服比较能感受到风……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e895ee6fa51af26fcbb2664301a82b49aeae32c3b32ed6401bfff363f779af8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b586d8017e12386aee0d8c29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生也同学教了我骑自行车。\r\n被扶着时感触到的风，\r\n散发着一种异国气息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c939225570cdbfc61da5dfe9ed7da8856505805e0a6bad334a8da6d3b52fdab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679985bf1b632eac31be4adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乱蓬蓬很喜欢诗歌剧同学，\r\n总是会围着她转。\r\n我都有点嫉妒了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "446a2f10abbeb4c0355429acffc2a671dfe549410496b7b92d1f072a3999c25d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91017"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
